<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 10-yr BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 10-yr BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   November 1, 2006    previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.32 pct vs	6.24 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.29 pct vs	7.22 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  104.05   vs    104.60</p>
<p> Bids		 3.176 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The previous auction was of a third tranche of the 10-year, 7.75 percent BTP on November 15.</p>
</text>
